<title>USA: Sierra Pacific Resources names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Sierra Pacific Resources names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sierra Pacific Resources Corp said Friday it has named Mark Ruelle senior vice president, chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
<p>Ruelle will also fill those same posts at Sierra Pacific Power Co, the company's utility subsidiary.</p>
<p>Ruelle succeeds Malyn Malquist, who was last fall was named principal operations officer for the utility subsidiary, the company said.</p>
<p>Most recently, Ruelle was president of Westar Energy, a subsidiary of Western Resources Inc.</p>
